{
  "_comment": "ILLUSTRATIVE sample of Perception (C2) producing one MRI Finding from many detections + a report, then handing it to Connectome. Not runnable, not a real patient. Ties to samples/connectome/patient-example.json (produces find-mri-001 for study-mri-001).",

